> Changes from v7:
>  * Minor renaming of parameters and updated comments
> Changes from v5:
>  * Further improve comments
> Changes from v4:
>  * Improve comments
> Changes from v2:
>  * Make output arguments optional.
>  * Mask RIPAS value rmi_rtt_read_entry()
>  * Drop unused rmi_rtt_get_phys()
